 4. 🌊 Photo du jour 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Photo: Caroline Brehman/AFP via Getty Images Crews placed boulders along the coast to prevent further erosion and protect the road from collapsing into the ocean at Westward Beach Road in Malibu, Calif., yesterday. 

 Coastal erosion from waves, storms and rising sea levels is accelerating the loss of Southern California's beaches and cliffs, threatening homes, roads and wildlife along the coast. 
 
